profile.POTATO=Potato
profile.DEFAULT=Default
profile.EXTREME=Extreme
profile.POTATO.comment=Low shadow and cloud quality. Disables cloud shadows, reflections, refraction, underwater sunbeams, caustics, foam, nebulae and auroras. Keeps held lights, ripples, stars, meteors and the blood moon.
profile.DEFAULT.comment=Enables extra effects with medium shadow, cloud and underwater sunbeam quality.
profile.EXTREME.comment=Enables extra effects with high shadow, cloud and underwater sunbeam quality at a higher rendering cost.
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting
screen.CELESTIAL=Celestial Bodies
screen.CLOUDS_FOG=Clouds and Fog
screen.WATER=Water
screen.OTHER=Other Features
option.SHADOWS=Sun and Moon Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Shadows cast by objects blocking sunlight or moonlight in the Overworld. Disable to reduce rendering cost.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Pixels along each side of the shadow map. Higher values improve detail and increase memory use and rendering cost.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=Horizontal shadow range in blocks. Longer ranges increase rendering cost and reduce detail at a fixed resolution.
option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Edge Quality
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Controls the smoothness of soft shadow edges. Higher quality increases rendering cost.
value.SHADOW_FILTER.0=Low
value.SHADOW_FILTER.1=Medium
value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=High
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Controls the width of softened shadow edges. Higher values soften edges and reduce small shadow details.
option.SHADOW_NORMAL_BIAS=Shadow Surface Offset
option.SHADOW_NORMAL_BIAS.comment=Reduces shadow stripes on surfaces. Excessive values can detach shadows from objects.
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH=Ambient Light Strength
option.AMBIENT_STRENGTH.comment=Controls ambient illumination and the visibility of details in shadow.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun and Moon Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilt of the sun and moon path, in degrees.
option.FOG_DENSITY=Distance Fog Density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Controls how distant scenery blends into the fog color. Set to 0 to disable distance fog in air.
option.WATER_OPACITY=Deep water absorption
option.WATER_OPACITY.comment=Controls gradual coloring and bottom obscuration beyond two blocks of water depth.
option.EXPOSURE=Image Brightness
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Adjusts overall image brightness.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT=Handheld Moving Lights
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT.comment=Luminous items in either hand illuminate surfaces near the camera. Supports item light colors without separate shadows; light may pass through walls. Does not control other players or dropped items.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Moving Light Brightness
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts handheld illumination. Light from both hands adds together.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_RANGE=Moving Light Range
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_RANGE.comment=Maximum range in blocks for a full-brightness handheld light. Dimmer items have a shorter range.
option.MOON_STYLE=Moon Appearance
option.MOON_STYLE.comment=Choose a round or vanilla moon in the Overworld. Both follow the game moon phases.
value.MOON_STYLE.0=Vanilla
value.MOON_STYLE.1=Round
option.MOON_DIAMETER=Round Moon Diameter
option.MOON_DIAMETER.comment=Apparent diameter in degrees. Applies to the round moon only and does not affect moonlight range.
option.MOON_BRIGHTNESS=Round Moon Brightness
option.MOON_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts the round moon surface brightness without changing ground illumination or shadows. Round mode only.

screen.SKY=Sky
screen.STARS=Stars
screen.METEORS=Meteors
option.STARS_ENABLED=Stars
option.STARS_ENABLED.comment=Show procedural stars in the Overworld. Vanilla stars remain disabled.
option.STAR_DENSITY=Star Density
option.STAR_DENSITY.comment=Controls star count. Lower values leave more open sky.
option.STAR_SIZE=Star Size
option.STAR_SIZE.comment=Scales round stars while preserving their size variation.
option.STAR_BRIGHTNESS=Star Brightness
option.STAR_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts stars without changing the sky background or ground lighting.
option.STAR_COLOR_STRENGTH=Star Color Strength
option.STAR_COLOR_STRENGTH.comment=Controls blue-white, warm yellow and orange-red tint strength. 0 gives white stars.
option.STAR_TWINKLE=Star Twinkle Amount
option.STAR_TWINKLE.comment=Controls smooth brightness variation. 0 disables twinkling.
option.STAR_TWINKLE_SPEED=Star Twinkle Speed
option.STAR_TWINKLE_SPEED.comment=Controls twinkle speed. Applies when twinkle amount is above 0.
option.METEORS_ENABLED=Meteors
option.METEORS_ENABLED.comment=Shows meteors in the Overworld night sky. Hidden in daylight and full rain; does not light the ground.
option.METEOR_NIGHT_CHANCE=Meteor Night Chance
option.METEOR_NIGHT_CHANCE.comment=Chance for each game night to have meteors. 0.15 means 15%; 0 means never and 1 means every night. The result is fixed for a given day; meteors may cross outside your view.
option.METEOR_INTERVAL=Meteor Interval
option.METEOR_INTERVAL.comment=Interval in running-game seconds during meteor nights. Ordinary meteors appear once per interval; showers are more frequent and may have simultaneous meteors.
option.METEOR_DURATION=Meteor Duration
option.METEOR_DURATION.comment=Seconds from the appearance of each meteor to its disappearance.
option.METEOR_SPEED=Meteor Speed
option.METEOR_SPEED.comment=Angular travel speed in degrees per second.
option.METEOR_LENGTH=Meteor Trail Length
option.METEOR_LENGTH.comment=Maximum apparent trail length in degrees. The trail grows as the meteor moves.
option.METEOR_WIDTH=Meteor Trail Width
option.METEOR_WIDTH.comment=Scales the thickness of the meteor head and trail.
option.METEOR_BRIGHTNESS=Meteor Brightness
option.METEOR_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts head and trail brightness without affecting ground lighting.
option.METEOR_COLOR=Meteor Color
option.METEOR_COLOR.comment=Selects the color of the meteor head and trail.
value.STARS_ENABLED.0=Off
value.STARS_ENABLED.1=On
value.METEORS_ENABLED.0=Off
value.METEORS_ENABLED.1=On
value.METEOR_COLOR.0=Blue-white
value.METEOR_COLOR.1=White
value.METEOR_COLOR.2=Warm gold

option.METEOR_SHOWER_CHANCE=Meteor Shower Chance
option.METEOR_SHOWER_CHANCE.comment=Chance of a shower within meteor nights. 0.5 means 50%; 0 gives only ordinary meteors and 1 makes every meteor night a shower. Fixed for each day. Showers have more frequent and simultaneous meteors with a higher rendering cost.

screen.AURORA=Aurora
option.AURORA_ENABLED=Aurora
option.AURORA_ENABLED.comment=Shows aurora groups across both sides of the sky and overhead in cold Overworld biomes at night. Bands within each group share a direction. Fades across biome boundaries and during rain or snow.
option.AURORA_BRIGHTNESS=Aurora Brightness
option.AURORA_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts aurora brightness without changing ground lighting.
option.AURORA_SIZE=Aurora Coverage
option.AURORA_SIZE.comment=Adjusts how widely each aurora ribbon spreads across the sky.
option.AURORA_HEIGHT=Aurora Curtain Height
option.AURORA_HEIGHT.comment=Adjusts the upward extent of aurora curtains.
option.AURORA_SPEED=Aurora Motion Speed
option.AURORA_SPEED.comment=Adjusts curtain motion speed. 0 keeps the curtains still.
value.AURORA_ENABLED.0=Off
value.AURORA_ENABLED.1=On


screen.FANTASY=Fantasy Night Sky
option.FANTASY_SKY=Fantasy Night Sky
option.FANTASY_SKY.comment=Shows fantasy nebulae and a periodic blood moon in the Overworld at night. Disable for the normal starry sky.
value.FANTASY_SKY.0=Off
value.FANTASY_SKY.1=On
option.FANTASY_NEBULA=Nebula Haze
option.FANTASY_NEBULA.comment=Adds colored nebula haze to the fantasy sky, purple by default. Only affects the sky and fades in rain or snow.
value.FANTASY_NEBULA.0=Off
value.FANTASY_NEBULA.1=On
option.NEBULA_BRIGHTNESS=Nebula Brightness
option.NEBULA_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts nebula haze brightness.
option.FANTASY_BLOOD_MOON=Blood Moon
option.FANTASY_BLOOD_MOON.comment=A giant red satellite appears at the configured interval in the fantasy sky. Preserves the ordinary moon; does not affect mobs, ground lighting or gameplay events.
value.FANTASY_BLOOD_MOON.0=Off
value.FANTASY_BLOOD_MOON.1=On
option.BLOOD_MOON_DIAMETER=Blood Moon Angular Diameter
option.BLOOD_MOON_DIAMETER.comment=Apparent diameter of the blood moon in degrees.
option.BLOOD_MOON_PERIOD=Blood Moon Interval
option.BLOOD_MOON_PERIOD.comment=Game days between blood moons. 0 shows it every night; other values show it once per interval. The default of 8 days matches the vanilla moon-phase cycle.

screen.NEBULA=Nebula Haze
option.NEBULA_COLOR=Nebula Color
option.NEBULA_COLOR.comment=Selects the main nebula color; purple by default.
option.NEBULA_DENSITY=Haze Density
option.NEBULA_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the density of luminous nebula haze.
option.NEBULA_COVERAGE=Coverage
option.NEBULA_COVERAGE.comment=Adjusts the width of the nebula band across the sky.
option.NEBULA_SCALE=Cloud Size
option.NEBULA_SCALE.comment=Larger values create broader clouds; smaller values create smaller patches.
option.NEBULA_DETAIL=Detail Strength
option.NEBULA_DETAIL.comment=Adjusts fine nebula texture strength; lower values look softer.
option.NEBULA_DUST=Dust Lanes
option.NEBULA_DUST.comment=Adjusts dark lanes and gaps within the nebula; 0 disables them.
option.NEBULA_SPEED=Motion Speed
option.NEBULA_SPEED.comment=Adjusts slow nebula motion; 0 keeps it still.
option.NEBULA_ROTATION=Nebula Orientation
option.NEBULA_ROTATION.comment=Rotates the nebula around the vertical sky axis, in degrees.
value.NEBULA_COLOR.0=Purple
value.NEBULA_COLOR.1=Blue
value.NEBULA_COLOR.2=Rose
value.NEBULA_COLOR.3=Gold

screen.SUN=Sun
option.SUN_STYLE=Sun Appearance
option.SUN_STYLE.comment=Selects the procedural round sun or the vanilla sun in the Overworld.
option.SUN_DIAMETER=Sun Angular Diameter
option.SUN_DIAMETER.comment=Apparent diameter of the round sun in degrees.
option.SUN_BRIGHTNESS=Sun Brightness
option.SUN_BRIGHTNESS.comment=Adjusts round sun and halo brightness without changing ground lighting or shadows.
option.SUN_HALO_STRENGTH=Sun Halo Strength
option.SUN_HALO_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the soft halo around the round sun; 0 disables it.
option.SUN_HALO_SIZE=Sun Halo Extent
option.SUN_HALO_SIZE.comment=Adjusts how far the round sun halo extends.
value.SUN_STYLE.0=Vanilla
value.SUN_STYLE.1=Round

option.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS=Volumetric clouds
option.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS.comment=Volumetric cloud banks in the Overworld, obscuring the sky, sun and moons.
option.CLOUD_SAMPLES=Cloud quality
option.CLOUD_SAMPLES.comment=Higher quality reduces cloud noise at a higher GPU cost.
option.CLOUD_LIGHTNING=Lightning-lit Clouds
option.CLOUD_LIGHTNING.comment=Brief cool-white illumination near lightning during thunderstorms. Inactive when the shader loader does not provide lightning position data.
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE=Cloud base altitude
option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE.comment=World height of the cloud base, in blocks.
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS=Fair-weather cloud thickness
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS.comment=Vertical thickness in blocks; rain and thunderstorms thicken the layer.
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud coverage
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Cloud coverage, also influenced by weather and biome.
option.CLOUD_DENSITY=Cloud density
option.CLOUD_DENSITY.comment=Higher values make clouds more opaque and darken cloud bases and shadows.
option.CLOUD_SCALE=Cloud bank size
option.CLOUD_SCALE.comment=Horizontal size of cloud banks and their ground shadows.
option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud movement speed
option.CLOUD_SPEED.comment=Movement of clouds and their shadows; zero keeps them stationary.
option.CLOUD_DISTANCE=Cloud distance
option.CLOUD_DISTANCE.comment=Maximum cloud rendering distance, in blocks.
option.CLOUD_BIOME_VARIATION=Biome cloud variation
option.CLOUD_BIOME_VARIATION.comment=Wetter biomes have more clouds; mountain highlands have fewer in fair weather. Zero uses uniform fair-weather coverage.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Cloud shadows
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment=Moving cloud shadows from sunlight and moonlight on terrain and water.
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_STRENGTH=Cloud shadow strength
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_STRENGTH.comment=Strength of cloud shading on direct sun and moonlight, preserving ambient and item light.
value.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS.0=Off
value.VOLUMETRIC_CLOUDS.1=On
value.CLOUD_SHADOWS.0=Off
value.CLOUD_SHADOWS.1=On
value.CLOUD_SAMPLES.16=Low
value.CLOUD_SAMPLES.32=Medium
value.CLOUD_SAMPLES.48=High

option.WATER_FOG_DENSITY=Underwater fog density
option.WATER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Controls how quickly underwater views become foggy with distance.

option.WATER_WAVES=Surface waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Animated surface ripples and sun/moon highlights.
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave strength
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the apparent slope of water ripples.
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED=Wave speed
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED.comment=Speed of waves and shoreline foam; zero freezes the animation.
option.WATER_FOAM=Shore foam
option.WATER_FOAM.comment=Broken white foam in shallow water near visible banks.
option.WATER_FOAM_WIDTH=Foam depth range
option.WATER_FOAM_WIDTH.comment=Maximum water depth for foam, in blocks.
option.WATER_FOAM_STRENGTH=Foam strength
option.WATER_FOAM_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the opacity of white foam.
value.WATER_WAVES.0=Off
value.WATER_WAVES.1=On
value.WATER_FOAM.0=Off
value.WATER_FOAM.1=On

option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Reflects the sky and visible scenery. Objects outside the screen cannot appear in reflections.
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=On

option.WATER_REFRACTION=Water refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Ripples gently distort opaque scenery seen through water. Limited to visible scenery.
value.WATER_REFRACTION.0=Off
value.WATER_REFRACTION.1=On

option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Underwater caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=While submerged, nearby sunlit terrain beneath you receives moving light patterns.
option.WATER_CAUSTIC_STRENGTH=Caustic strength
option.WATER_CAUSTIC_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of moving light patterns on underwater terrain.
value.WATER_CAUSTICS.0=Off
value.WATER_CAUSTICS.1=On
option.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS=Underwater Sunbeams
option.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Sunbeams with terrain occlusion underwater in clear weather. Requires shadows.
value.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS.0=Off
value.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS.1=On
option.WATER_SHAFT_STRENGTH=Underwater Sunbeam Strength
option.WATER_SHAFT_STRENGTH.comment=Controls the brightness of sunlight scattered in water.
option.WATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES=Underwater Sunbeam Quality
option.WATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.comment=Higher quality smooths sunbeam occlusion edges at a higher underwater rendering cost.
value.WATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.4=Low
value.WATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.8=Medium
value.WATER_SHAFT_SAMPLES.12=High

screen.VEGETATION=Lively Vegetation
option.VEGETATION_WIND=Lively Vegetation
option.VEGETATION_WIND.comment=Animates classified grass, crops, sugar cane, aquatic plants and leaves in the Overworld, with matching shadows. DH distant geometry stays still.
value.VEGETATION_WIND.0=Off
value.VEGETATION_WIND.1=On
option.VEGETATION_WIND_SPEED=Wind Speed
option.VEGETATION_WIND_SPEED.comment=Controls vegetation motion speed. Zero freezes a fixed pose; disable Lively Vegetation to restore the original shape.
option.WIND_GRASS_STRENGTH=Grass and Flower Sway
option.WIND_GRASS_STRENGTH.comment=Controls grass, flower and sapling sway with fixed roots. Zero disables their movement.
option.WIND_CROP_STRENGTH=Crop Sway
option.WIND_CROP_STRENGTH.comment=Controls selected crops such as wheat and carrots. Does not animate full blocks such as pumpkins or melons.
option.WIND_REED_STRENGTH=Sugar Cane Sway
option.WIND_REED_STRENGTH.comment=Controls subtle continuous movement across sugar cane segments. Does not simulate bending around the base of an entire stalk.
option.WIND_WATER_STRENGTH=Aquatic Plant Sway
option.WIND_WATER_STRENGTH.comment=Controls slow seagrass and kelp movement. Seagrass roots stay fixed; kelp segments sway gently together.
option.WIND_LEAF_STRENGTH=Leaf Sway
option.WIND_LEAF_STRENGTH.comment=Controls gentle leaf motion. Trunks stay still. Rain increases land vegetation sway.
